1
00:00:00,642 --> 00:00:04,812
(Leonard:)-Okay, so Kripke played a joke on you.
-It wasn't funny.

2
00:00:05,021 --> 00:00:06,061
[IN NORMAL VOICE]
I thought it was funny.

3
00:00:06,231 --> 00:00:08,061
(Penny:)-Raj.
-You laughed.

4
00:00:09,567 --> 00:00:10,897
(Sheldon:)Did you laugh?

5
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:14,280
(Leonard:)I fell on the floor.

6
00:00:15,907 --> 00:00:18,827
(Leonard:)All right, he got you.
You can get him back.

7
00:00:19,035 --> 00:00:21,915
(Sheldon:)-I refuse to sink to his level.
-You can't sink.

8
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:26,040
(Raj:)With all that helium in you,
you're lucky you don't float away.

9
00:00:28,670 --> 00:00:30,590
(Leonard:)Are you really admitting defeat?

10
00:00:30,755 --> 00:00:32,635
(Sheldon:)-I never admit defeat.
-Good.

11
00:00:32,799 --> 00:00:37,429
(Sheldon:)However, on an unrelated topic,
I'm never getting out of this bed again.

12
00:00:37,595 --> 00:00:41,265
(Leonard:)What if you could make Kripke
look even sillier than he made you look?

13
00:00:41,433 --> 00:00:43,933
(Raj:)-I don't think that's possible.
-You're not helping.

14
00:00:44,102 --> 00:00:46,852
(Raj:)I didn't come to help. I came to mock.

15
00:00:47,772 --> 00:00:49,272
(Leonard:)Sheldon, what you need to do...

16
00:00:49,441 --> 00:00:53,571
(Leonard:)...is figure out a way
to exact vengeance on Kripke, like....

17
00:00:54,070 --> 00:00:56,030
(Leonard:)Like how the Joker got back at Batman...

18
00:00:56,197 --> 00:00:59,367
(Leonard:)...for putting him in the Arkham Asylum
for the Criminally Insane.

19
00:00:59,576 --> 00:01:02,786
He didn't stay and talk about his feelings
with the other villains.

